direction: down
title: RabbitMQ Flow Control: basicQos Backpressure

Broker: RabbitMQ Broker
Worker: Worker Pod (basicQos = 2)

Worker -> Worker: Configures basicQos(2)
Broker -> Worker: 1. Push Message 1 (Unacked: 1) { style.stroke: "#F59E0B" }
Broker -> Worker: 2. Push Message 2 (Unacked: 2 - Limit reached) { style.stroke: "#F59E0B" }
Broker -> Broker: Pauses pushing messages
Worker -> Worker: Finishes Msg 1
Worker -> Broker: 3. basicAck(tag=1) { style.stroke: "#34D399" }
Broker -> Broker: Unacked drops to 1
Broker -> Worker: 4. Push Message 3 (Unacked: 2) { style.stroke: "#F59E0B" }
